plans.379c48b1214ea3db76d85ebf633bea23:
{"text":"The quiet is explained by the campaigns stopping. Marketing started the Norway spring campaign on 24 March 2026, and its ads stopped on 9 May 2026, when the Norway regulator paused all price promotions while it writes new pricing rules [itm_eprlkrz2]. Marketing's owner notes that the Norway campaigns were all price promotions, so no paid campaign has run there since [itm_za26xpzv]. Read that way, there is little return on ad spend in Norway after May because there was little paid spend there.

