Return on ad spend is defined as net revenue attributed to paid media divided by paid media spend, with last-click attribution within 30 days [metric:return_on_ad_spend]. Paid media ownership sits with Priya Nair and Marketing with Tomas Eriksen, as the owners listed for those domains. I read 1 May to 23 October 2026 across 21 published context items you may read. I found nothing written that gives a Norway return figure for that period.","calls":[]}

plans.d9ed1c35638da3c5b2a496ee9b5d4e6f:
{"text":"Heed holds no decision about moving Spain back, and I can't say whether you should. What is written is that Spain's payments moved to a new provider on 21 October 2025, and that it records a first order on the day it is approved, so first-time buyers land a day later than before [itm_m84x8rur]. Its note says that fewer first-time buyers in Spain on that date does not mean fewer new customers, since they moved to the next day [itm_m84x8rur].

