plans.a51416f82d84986709504a7a07feeffd:
{"text":"The guide that covers this is written for return on ad spend for one campaign. It says a campaign's return counts orders for 30 days after sign-up, so you should read a campaign only once its 30 days have passed. It also warns that a low return in a campaign's first weeks is not its final result [itm_roascampaign]. The guide is owned by Paid media and was last checked on 29 September 2026.

