plans.f0f6243b2df6314f1ec38e5ffd44b52a:
{"text":"Nothing I can read says which market grew fastest this year. I searched the 21 published context items you may read for market growth from 1 January to 23 October 2026, and none of them state a growth figure or compare markets. The closest matches are notes on how to read Orders and Gross margin in France, Germany, Norway and Spain, such as [itm_2a1wp53q] and [itm_0tmqp7o1]. They explain how to interpret the figures, but they do not give any market's growth. Heed also keeps no business figures, so I cannot compute growth myself.

Some of these notes flag events that would distort a comparison this year. Payment provider switches in France on 12 May and 21 May 2026 are recorded in [itm_franceswitch12] and [itm_franceswitch21], and Norway's launch campaign ran from 24 March to 9 May 2026 per [itm_eprlkrz2]. Those items warn against reading those months as customer changes, though they do not measure growth.

