{"text":"Customer value has more metrics left blank. Of its 6 metrics with definitions, 4 have no context item written about them: Active customers, Churn rate, Customer lifetime value and Repeat purchase rate. Only 2 of 2 context items in Customer value you may read exist, covering First-time buyers and New customers.

